==============================================================================
  shuffled-LP2 null: cv_nz 0.0461 +/- 0.0065    REAL 0.0567   z = +1.64
  chi2 of the 28 nonzero diagonals vs uniform = 41.4 on 27 df (critical 40.1 at p=0.05) -> non-flat
  z of the d=0 hole: observed 86 vs expected 446.7, z = -17.37

